											<SHORT-NAME>FeeMinimumReadPageSize</SHORT-NAME>
											<DESC>
												<L-2 L="EN">Minimum Page size will be a multiple of the minimum page size. Fee shall align read requests to this size.

Not used! 
Use the FeePartitionConfiguration/FeeReadAlignment instead.</L-2>
											</DESC>
